- description: Code quality queries ABOM runs against its own Go

# Pinned, like every other suite here, because an unpinned reference resolves to whatever the
# cache last downloaded. Measured 2026-09-10: running this unpinned pulled newer packs mid-run,
# so the same command on the same commit could report a different number of findings. A baseline
# that moves on its own cannot be a baseline, and a gate built on one cannot be a gate.
- import: codeql-suites/go-code-quality.qls
  from: codeql/go-queries
  version: 1.6.10
